Package: rodano
Type: Package
Title: R SDK for Rodano API
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Jonathan Salfati", email = "jonathan.salfati@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides an R SDK for interacting with the Rodano API. It includes 
    helper functions, communication utilities, and test scripts to facilitate 
    integration with the Rodano platform. Features include data export, data 
    management with fine-grained rights API, and workflow management.
